28
00:00:42,414 --> 00:00:42,817
Jupiter

29
00:00:42,817 --> 00:00:43,168
Saturn

30
00:00:43,168 --> 00:00:43,521
Uranus

31
00:00:43,521 --> 00:00:44,526
