32
00:00:44,526 --> 00:00:45,625
Jupiter is so big

33
00:00:45,625 --> 00:00:48,740
it's like a giant bouncy ball that can hold over 1

34
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:49,351
300 Earths

35
00:00:49,351 --> 00:00:51,351
inside it!

36
00:00:51,351 --> 00:00:53,335
And don't forget Earth's best friend

37
00:00:53,335 --> 00:00:53,765
the Moon

38
00:00:53,765 --> 00:00:58,018
It follows us around and helps make the ocean
