39
00:00:58,018 --> 00:00:58,591
just like

40
00:00:58,591 --> 00:01:00,591
magic

41
00:01:00,591 --> 00:01:04,385
Every planet in this cosmic neighborhood moves
around the Sun in a big

42
00:01:04,385 --> 00:01:04,813
swirling

43
00:01:04,813 --> 00:01:06,813
dance

44
00:01:06,813 --> 00:01:11,638
This dance is why we have days and nights and
how we know what's nighttime or

45
00:01:11,638 --> 00:01:13,638
daytime here on Earth

46
00:01:13,638 --> 00:01:15,143
Next time you see the sky

47
